        "text_dqyycF": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<ol><li>The B-Wagon is available at Orange Beach, Fort Morgan, and Gulf Shores in Alabama. </li><li>Select the combination of additional gear that you may need for the rental.</li><li>Pick the days you want the rental. </li><li>Input a location and times where you would like us to drop off and pickup the B-Wagon.</li><li>Provide any additional details that may help us support you. </li><li>Once this is information is completed, select add to cart and continue to the checkout and payment page. </li><li>Once we receive the order, our rental manager will reach out by phone to confirm and coordinate the rental.</li><li>Note that the payment will not be collected until the cart has been delivered.</li><li>Note that we may charge a security deposit at the time of delivery, this will be refunded upon return of the B-Wagon.</li><li>If you have any additional requests or concerns give us a call at 715-292-3414.</li><li>Please see the Quick Reminder and Terms of Service below.</li><li>Get out there and enjoy life!</li></ol><p></p>"
          }
        }
