            "heading": "Quick Reminder",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_VkHpzL": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Hey there! I’m your friendly beach wagon, and I’m here to make your day on the sand a breeze! But before we get rolling, I’ve got a few important things to share with you, so we can have a smooth and safe day together:</p><ol><li><strong>Please don’t ride me.</strong> I know I look fun, but I’m built to carry your stuff, not you. We don’t want anyone getting hurt!</li><li><strong>Keep an eye on me.</strong> Don’t leave me unattended for too long. I’m pretty helpful, and we wouldn’t want me wandering off or getting borrowed by someone else.</li><li><strong>Watch your surroundings.</strong> I know you're excited to get that perfect spot on the beach, but be mindful of others. I don’t want to bump into anyone or accidentally knock over someone’s beach umbrella!</li><li><strong>Keep me clean and dry please.</strong> Sand’s okay, but water isn’t my thing. Please don’t drive me into the ocean, and give me a quick wipe-down if I get too sandy.</li></ol><p>I can’t wait to help you enjoy your day out here! Let’s get where you want to go! 🌞🌊</p>"
          }
        },
